:: Carter Yard Play Water Slide [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> are sitting atop the jungle gym, dangling and swinging your legs about as you chat, <span style="Color: LightGreen">when an idea suddenly pops into the small boy’s head.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! I got a super fun idea!”</span> He says, leaping off of the jungle gym into the grass below. You watch as your friend rushes over to the side of the house and grabs the hose. He then runs it towards the slide at the top of the jungle gym and turns it on, creating a bit of a waterfall that slips down the slide. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ta-da!”</span> He proclaims with a smile, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“instant waterslide! Pretty cool, right?”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Swim",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

You leap down as well and walk over, nodding as you inspect his makeshift creation. Even at full blast, the water from the hose doesn’t coat the entire slide, though it still looks pretty neat and a large puddle was forming in the grass below. <span style="Color: LightGreen">All in all? Not a bad idea. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> smiles at your praise, grabbing you by the hand and pulling you to the back of the slide.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Let’s go down it!”</span> He says, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We have to be quick, dad will get mad if we flood the yard, so can’t use the hose forever.”</span> You agree and follow <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> up the slide. But now the choice presents itself. <span style="Color: Yellow">Do you go down the slide with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> or dive down headfirst?</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Go down with Carter<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        Once at the top of the slide, you ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> if the two of you could go down together. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> quickly agrees, <span style="Color: Pink">though pouts a little when he has to basically sit down on your lap with your arms around him.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why do I always have to be the little spoon!?”</span> He asks with puffed out cheeks. You can’t help but laugh and ask him where he heard that term before. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s what <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> calls it! Once I hit my growth spurt, I’m going to ALWAYS be the big spoon!”</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Eyes: "Tired",
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Carter",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Swim",
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                        Eyes: "Tired",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s pouting ends once the two of you actually go down the slide, the water wetting the plastic to make you go nearly twice as fast as you normally would, twisting up the side of the coiled slide until you fly off the end and – <span style="Color: Yellow">SPLASH</span> – <span style="Color: LightGreen">right into the puddle, covering both of your butts with mud as you stand up laughing.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Dang! We went so fast!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says happily, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Let’s go again! <br>
        <br>”</span> 
        The two of you spend the next few minutes going down the wetted slide as the hose propels you at fast speeds. You stop once the yard is starting to get a little too soaked and you both are very muddy. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We should hose off the mud before we turn it off.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says as he sprays you with the water, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That way we don’t get the pool dirty with the mud.”</span> <br>
        <span style="color:green">+Carter Comfort</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
        <span style="color:Red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Backyard Swim]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Slide down headfirst<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        You decide to go down on your own and, after <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> has splashed down in the mud, decide to do so headfirst! <span style="Color: Yellow">Why you decide to do this, despite knowing what is at the bottom, is a mystery. Maybe you don’t realize what will happen, maybe you are trying to be funny, or maybe you just want to dive face first into mud, because that is exactly what happens.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightCoral">SPLASH!</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Carter",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Swim",
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: Yellow">Your entire upper half is drenched in mud and water as you splash down at the bottom of the slide. You actually bruise your nose a little, going down so fast, and realize this may not have been the best idea.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Careful!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs as he runs over to help you up, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I don’t want you get hurt here. That was pretty funny though!”</span> The two of you spend the next few minutes going down the wetted slide as the hose propels you down. You stop once the yard is starting to get a little too soaked and you both are very muddy. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We should hose off the mud before we turn it off.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says as he sprays you with the water, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That way we don’t get the pool dirty with the mud.”</span> <br>
        <span style="color:Red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 10>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Backyard Swim]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>